{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":15464,\"date\":\"2026-06-13T19:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-13T16:59:14+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-nuove-app-apple-watch\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27 porta nuove app su Apple Watch\",\"excerpt\":\"Con watchOS 27 arrivano due nuove app su Apple Watch, ampliando l’offerta disponibile direttamente sul dispositivo indossabile.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/watchos-27.jpg-768x384.webp\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27.jpg\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15366,\"date\":\"2026-06-09T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-08T19:57:55+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-taglia-supporto-apple-watch-series-9-ultra-1-se-2\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27 taglia il supporto per Apple Watch Series 9, Ultra 1 e SE 2\",\"excerpt\":\"watchOS 27 non supporterà Apple Watch Series 9, Apple Watch Ultra (prima generazione) e Apple Watch SE (seconda generazione). La compatibilità si ferma ai modelli con chip S9/S10.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Watch-Series-9-Pink-Aluminum-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Series-9-Pink-Aluminum-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15275,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-pubblica-wallpaper-playlist-video-get-ready-per-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica wallpaper, playlist e video “Get Ready” per WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Prima dell’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple rende disponibili una nuova wallpaper per iPhone, iPad e Mac, una playlist su Apple Music e un video “Get Ready” per prepararsi all’evento.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC-2026-Wallpaper-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC-2026-Wallpaper\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15273,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:39+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:39+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-manca-una-settimana-placeholder-youtube-keynote-diretta\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026, manca una settimana: placeholder YouTube e keynote in diretta\",\"excerpt\":\"A una settimana dall’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple ha attivato un placeholder su YouTube con promemoria per il keynote del 8 giugno. La diretta sarà disponibile anche su Apple Events e Apple TV.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15230,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T17:30:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-29T23:24:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-pubbliche-ios-26-6-macos-tahoe-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6 e macOS Tahoe 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Disponibili le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6, iPadOS 26.6, macOS Tahoe 26.6, watchOS 26.6 e tvOS 26.6. Arrivano due giorni dopo le beta per sviluppatori.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15128,\"date\":\"2026-05-25T11:30:27+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-25T06:35:19+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-nuove-funzioni-salute-watch-face-satelliti-rumor\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27: nuove funzioni tra salute, watch face e satelliti (rumor)\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor su watchOS 27: miglioramenti al tracciamento della frequenza cardiaca, nuove watch face e possibili funzioni satellitari. Focus anche su stabilità e performance.\",\"categoryName\":\"Watch\",\"categorySlug\":\"watch\",\"categoryId\":186,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15100,\"date\":\"2026-05-23T16:30:50+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-23T16:00:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-siri-riprogettato-accessibilita-ios-27\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026: Siri riprogettato e nuove funzioni di accessibilità in iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple conferma WWDC 2026 (8-12 giugno). Attese novità su iOS 27, con un Siri ripensato, funzioni di accessibilità e aggiornamenti per iOS 27 e altri sistemi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14976,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T16:00:36+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:07:05+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-watch-ultra-4-redesign-monitoraggio-pressione\",\"title\":\"Apple Watch Ultra 4: redesign e monitoraggio della pressione\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo DigiTimes, Apple Watch Ultra 4 potrebbe arrivare con un redesign e una nuova funzione di notifiche per l’ipertensione, in revisione FDA.\",\"categoryName\":\"Watch\",\"categorySlug\":\"watch\",\"categoryId\":186,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14730,\"date\":\"2026-05-09T09:51:58+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-09T07:51:58+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-watch-series-12-watchos-27-cosa-aspettarsi\",\"title\":\"Apple Watch Series 12 e watchOS 27: cosa aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor su Touch ID, nuovi chip, nuove watch face e funzioni Apple Intelligence e satellite in watchOS 27, con lancio atteso a settembre.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-Touch-ID-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-Touch-ID\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":12945,\"date\":\"2026-02-03T09:57:40+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-09T19:57:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-aggiornamenti-macos-watchos\",\"title\":\"Apple Rilascia Aggiornamenti per macOS 11, watchOS 10 e watchOS 9 per Mantenere iMessage e FaceTime Funzionanti su Dispositivi Più Vecchi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato macOS 11.7.11, watchOS 10.6.2 e watchOS 9.6.4 per dispositivi più vecchi, garantendo il funzionamento di iMessage e FaceTime fino a gennaio 2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/apple-watch-se-red-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple watch se red\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":27,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":12860,\"date\":\"2026-01-30T21:11:08+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-01-30T20:11:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilasciato-settimana-gennaio-2026\",\"title\":\"Ecco Tutto Ciò che Apple ha Rilasciato Questa Settimana\",\"excerpt\":\"La settimana finale di gennaio è stata intensa per Apple, con nuovi AirTag, un nuovo Black Unity band per Apple Watch e il bundle Apple Creator Studio ora disponibile.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/01/imac-video-apple-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"imac video apple feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":48,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":10876,\"date\":\"2025-11-05T17:49:12+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-11-05T16:49:12+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuova-versione-siri-google-gemini\",\"title\":\"Nuova versione di Siri si affiderà a Google Gemini\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple prevede di lanciare una versione rinnovata di Siri a marzo del prossimo anno, integrando un modello basato su Google Gemini.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/11/Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple Intelligence General Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":70,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":8232,\"date\":\"2023-09-12T22:40:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2023-09-12T21:07:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-presenta-apple-watch-ultra-2\",\"title\":\"Apple presenta Apple Watch Ultra 2\",\"excerpt\":\"Durante l'evento \\\"Wonderlust\\\", Apple ha svelato ufficialmente il suo nuovo smartwatch, l'Apple Watch Ultra 2, rivolto agli amanti dell'avventura. Dal punto di vista del design, questo nuovo modello rimane sostanzialmente invariato rispetto al suo predecessore, ma ci sono significative migliorie in termini di prestazioni e sostenibilità, dimostrando l'impegno di Cupertino per la tutela dell'ambiente attraverso…\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2023/09/Screenshot-2023-09-12-alle-19.29.30-768x431.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Screenshot alle\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d