/App-Store-Awards-2021-banner-768x432.webp\",\"imageAlt\":\"App Store Awards 2021 banner jpeg\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3217,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":589,\"date\":\"2020-11-15T14:31:51+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2020-11-15T13:31:56+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-potrebbe-avere-una-sorpresa-in-serbo-per-natale\",\"title\":\"Apple potrebbe avere una sorpresa in serbo per Natale\",\"excerpt\":\"Quest'anno Apple ha rinnovato praticamente tutta la linea, partendo da iPhone SE2 per poi presentare iPhone 12, con iPhone 12, iPhone 12 mini, iPhone 12 Pro e iPhone 12 Pro Max. Ha presentato anche la nuova linea Mac, con Mac mini, MacBook Air e MacBook Pro. Proseguendo abbiamo nuovi iPad Air ed iPad per finire…\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2020/11/best_apple_christmas_deals_thumb800-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"best apple christmas deals thumb800\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3344,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null}],\"totalPages\":2}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":["tj-posts"]}